#=====================================================================
# gui_vlog.NX500 — V-Log curve page (EN)
#=====================================================================
# Every action goes through vlog.sh; the menu only forwards the verb.
#   V-Log Switch  idempotent: no curve -> apply, has curve -> restore
#   RESTORE       force factory gamma
#   Curve State   print the NXL_GAMMA_RELOAD1 block
#   Gate Check    run the seven vlog-arm.sh gates, popup shows verdict only
#
# Gate check and curve toggle stay separate on purpose: the gate covers
# A18 stock / PW neutral / USB unplugged, the toggle only touches gamma.
# Merging them would change two states per tap with no way to tell which.
#
# Keep labels within 6 full-width chars (mod_gui 2-column grid).
#=====================================================================

button|V-Log Switch|vlog.sh toggle
button|RESTORE|vlog.sh off
button|Curve State|vlog.sh status

button|Gate Check|vlog.sh gate
button|GO BACK|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_evwifi.NX500
button|CANCEL|/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_exit.sh
